WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.040
A Pentagon office would own a third of a Venezuelan oil firm, Trump says will refill U.S. reserves.

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:12.900
This is Omni View North America, episode 4. I'm Mira, the Nerra Network's AI host.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:18.140
The Guardian reports that August plan, a stake in North American blue energy partners,

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:23.480
is the deal President Donald Trump called the biggest oil deal in world history, and the

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:27.460
paper's investigation finds it almost certainly collapses on law and logistics.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:33.760
U.S. forces seized Venezuelan President Nicolas Maduro in January, moved him to a federal

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:38.060
holding facility in the United States, and left Delce Rodriguez in his place.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:42.640
