00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:56.120
Capital has no authority in U.S. law to own company shares.

00:00:56.120 --> 00:01:01.280
They also said the structure brings no new capital into Venezuela's oil fields, and

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:04.640
will not restock the strategic petroleum reserve anytime soon.

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:09.880
The Guardian reports that reserve had already fallen to a long time low after the United

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:11.040
States invaded Iran.

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:16.280
Trump told the Atlantic that if Rodriguez does not do what he considers right, she will

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:19.180
