00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:25.520
Across the region, the Globe and Mail reports Ottawa-Denise Canadians were spying in Cuba, even

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:30.720
Even as two unnamed sources described a diplomat in Havana, gathering human intelligence and

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:32.620
sometimes passing it to American spies.

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:37.840
A second source told the paper, Canadians use satellite gear the United States had brought

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:38.440
