00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:04.420
The paper is not naming the sources because disclosure could bring charges under the Foreign

00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:06.640
Interference and Security of Information Act.

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:13.240
A court sealed the new material in April 2025 after an amended claim filed in August 2024.

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:18.760
